<!--
    Advan Tab V8 / Alldocube iPlay 60 mini Pro (T812)
    Evolution X "bka" (Android 16 QPR2, release bp4a)

    Based on diggieman/local_manifests (branch EvoX/bka).
    Revisions are pinned to commits that were checked against each other;
    build.sh with the "latest" option replaces them with the "upstream" branch heads.
-->
